    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505">

                <pb facs="0696" n="572" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg572"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.1254 V 65/1</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Clerk of the Superior
                        Court of Essex Comity, Massachusetts</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-07-14"><hi rendition="#italic">July 14,
                        1923</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to request that you be good enough to
                    forward to the Department, for its information, a copy of the recent decision of
                    Justice William Cushing Wait in the case of the <hi rendition="#italic">United
                        States of Mexico</hi> v. <hi rendition="#italic">Mariano Viamonte y
                        Fernandez.</hi></p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William
                            Phillips</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Under
                    Secretary</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
